# Jurisdiction repair (2026-08-23, WO-47): the archive's ingest-time
# finalize_jurisdiction() shares app/utils/jurisdiction_enrich.py with
# the resolver, and every wordninja-backed tier in it (the validated
# subdomain/label extractor, and WO-47's glued-label repair) degrades to
# a silent decline when wordninja is missing -- discovered live when the
# deployed /internal/jurisdiction/backfill-apply recomputed only 48 of
# WO-47's 82 vetted candidates (all 34 missing ones were glued-label
# repairs like "Bouldercounty"/"RochestercityMN"). Without this, the
# archive service validates/repairs measurably less than the resolver
# does on identical input. Pure-Python, no transitive deps.
